Original commit body from 1f7bd90:

Documents how the sketch command decides:
- Section order (Header → Overview → Structure → ... → Source Content)
- Budget allocation strategy (waterfall with percentages)
- Ordering within sections (confidence, centrality, density, etc.)
- Cutoff logic (minimums, ceilings, guarantees)

Key design decisions documented:
- Entry Points before Source Files (higher signal first)
- Structure section uses tree format built from important files
- Key Symbols has minimum guarantee of 5 symbols
- Domain Vocabulary section removed (low value)

Also adds entrypoint confidence tiers to spec (0.99 declared,
0.95 decorator, 0.85 structural, 0.70 naming).
